# Build-time API base URL for the Digital Monster backend (API Gateway invoke URL).
# Example: https://abc123.execute-api.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com
#
# This is a FALLBACK. At runtime the app first tries to fetch `/config.json`
# from the site root (shape: { "apiBaseUrl": "https://..." }). If that file is
# present its `apiBaseUrl` wins, so a single CDK deploy can inject the API URL
# into S3 without rebuilding the bundle. If `/config.json` is absent, the app
# falls back to the VITE_API_BASE_URL baked in at build time (below).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
